WHY
---
The brush behaviour in this directory is a port of Blender's sculpt mode. It was written from the
mathematics, not transliterated from the C++, but it is still a derivative work of GPL-2.0-or-later
code, so it is distributed under GPL-3.0-or-later (which that licence allows). Serving this
JavaScript to a browser counts as distribution, so the source has to stay public.

The numbers themselves (0.25, 1.05, the falloff curves, the Essentials brush defaults) are facts
about Blender, measured or read off; the expression here is our own.

