Pinned at commit 235621eec717437a8dfe0a9dfbf78a3f7eb4c32f (blender/blender).

  source/blender/editors/sculpt_paint/paint_stroke.cc
      -> stroke.js       spacing, the overlap factor, the stabiliser, pressure interpolation,
                         the first-dab rule
  source/blender/editors/sculpt_paint/mesh/sculpt.cc
      -> cache.js        radius, the brush-strength table, area normal and centre, the brush plane
                         and its stabiliser, the accumulate rule, the hand delta
